idence.</p></section><section id="routine-keybinding-runtime-key-down"><h3><code>key_down</code></h3><p>Test one column-times-eight-plus-row physical switch while preserving caller indexes. Interface: <a href="#profile-keybindings">keybindings</a>. Source: <code>src/keybinding_runtime.s</code>; current source-reference module pages retain emitted-address and call evidence.</p></section><section id="routine-keybinding-runtime-key-capture"><h3><code>key_capture</code></h3><p>Reject conflicting or ambiguous keys and consume accepted or cancelled capture through release. Interface: <a href="#profile-keybindings">keybindings</a>. Source: <code>src/keybinding_runtime.s</code>; current source-reference module pages retain emitted-address and call evidence.</p></section><section id="routine-keybinding-runtime-key-tick"><h3><code>key_tick</code></h3><p>Navigate the seven actions and BACK or begin waiting for a replacement switch. Interface: <a href="#profile-keybindings">keybindings</a>. Source: <code>src/keybinding_runtime.s</code>; current source-reference module pages retain emitted-address and call evidence.</p></section><section id="routine-keybinding-runtime-key-paint"><h3><code>key_paint</code></h3><p>Repaint all hydrated rows or only the previous and current selected rows for the prepared owner. Interface: <a href="#profile-keybindings">keybindings</a>. Source: <code>src/keybinding_runtime.s</code>; current source-reference module pages retain emitted-address and call evidence.</p></section><section id="routine-keybinding-runtime-key-waiting"><h3><code>key_waiting</code></h3><p>Report whether the current row owns active capture parentheses. Interface: <a href="#profile-keybindings">keybindings</a>. Source: <code>src/keybinding_runtime.s</code>; current source-reference module pages retain emitted-address and call evidence.</p></section><section id="routine-keybinding-runtime-key-name"><h3><code>key_name</code></h3><p>Resolve a physical switch to its single glyph or d